	(descr "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 (v1.1) plugged into two 1x22 2.54 mm vertical SMD female headers (Harwin M20-786 land pattern, pin 1 left). Pads numbered as Espressif's ESP32-S3-DevKitC symbol. Courtyard = the two socket bodies; the devkit stands ~10 mm above the board, outline on F.Fab.")
